          │ Jira + Confluence — Search and update Jira issues, read and write Confluence │
          │                                                                              │
          │ community project, runs locally with your token                              │
          │ mcp-atlassian is a community project (sooperset/mcp-atlassian), not          │
          │ Atlassian's. It runs locally and sees your API token.                        │
          │                                                                              │
          │ Before you continue:                                                         │
          │   1. Open the API-token page and create a token (a label like “dhi”).        │
          │   2. Your site is the address you use for Jira, e.g. acme.atlassian.net.     │
          │   3. Atlassian Cloud only here; Server / Data Center use a personal token —  │
          │      edit the card for that.                                                 │
          │                                                                              │
          │ create it here: https://id.atlassian.com/manage-profile/security/api-tokens  │
          │                                                                              │
